## Notes from User Feedback

> **OpenRouter is primary**: Gemini is supplementary storage only for now
> **File deletion**: Only copies in `~/Work/brain` are deleted, not originals
> **Import**: Drag-and-drop only (current implementation is correct)
> **Full cleanup**: Deletion removes file, chunks, AND embeddings (no orphan data)
> **Model catalogs**: Stored in separate files in `src/main/models/` for easy editing
